{"id":"ec7b15e6613808fd","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-zfc-ord-fodor-witness.md","title":"ZFC Ord Fodor Witness","display":"df-zfc-ord-fodor-witness — ZFC Ord Fodor Witness","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ord-fodor-witness","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ord-fodor-witness"],"display":"df-zfc-ord-fodor-witness — ZFC Ord Fodor Witness","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-ord-regressive-function.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-stationary-subset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ord-fodor-witness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ord-fodor-witness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ord-fodor-witness — ZFC Ord Fodor Witness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c7dd49fa09ccee1a\" href=\"?note=c7dd49fa09ccee1a\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-zfc-ord-regressive-function.md\">../batch14/58-df-zfc-ord-regressive-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c6d862e552135487\" href=\"?note=c6d862e552135487\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-zfc-stationary-subset.md\">../batch03/58-df-zfc-stationary-subset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,f,\\xi\\in V\">\\(S,f,\\xi\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrdFodorWitness}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrdFodorWitness}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrdRegressiveFunction}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrdRegressiveFunction}_S\\)</span> (auxiliary predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrdStationarySubset}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrdStationarySubset}_S\\)</span> (stationary-subset alias predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c6d862e552135487\" href=\"?note=c6d862e552135487\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-zfc-stationary-subset.md\">../batch03/58-df-zfc-stationary-subset.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ord\\text{-}fodor\\text{-}witness} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrdFodorWitness}_S(\\xi,f,S)\\leftrightarrow \\xi\\in\\bigcup S\\land\\mathrm{ZfcOrdRegressiveFunction}_S(f,S)\\land \\mathrm{ZfcOrdStationarySubset}_S(\\{\\alpha\\in S:f(\\alpha)=\\xi\\},\\bigcup S)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ord\\text{-}fodor\\text{-}witness} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrdFodorWitness}_S(\\xi,f,S)\\leftrightarrow \\xi\\in\\bigcup S\\land\\mathrm{ZfcOrdRegressiveFunction}_S(f,S)\\land \\mathrm{ZfcOrdStationarySubset}_S(\\{\\alpha\\in S:f(\\alpha)=\\xi\\},\\bigcup S)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-zfc-ord-regressive-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"c7dd49fa09ccee1a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-ord-regre